  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8CEtCgh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&label=DISCORD&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fNameplate%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&label=Globox&style=for-the-badge&up_message=Wiki&url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/Nameplate/\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Globox1997/Nameplate/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/Nameplate?color=c4667b&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p>\n<p>根据生物的健康值显示其等级。需要基础模组，例如&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpgdifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">RpgDifficulty</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M0SY9ho.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"594\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p>\n<p>本模组专为 Fabric 开发。</p>\n<p>暂无计划开发 Forge 版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>整合包权限：<strong><br></strong></p>\n<p>欢迎在任何整合包中使用此模组</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>错误报告：</p>\n<p>请在 GitHub 页面上报告错误</p>",
